    ["<Assistant_Title1>【铃兰与骑士】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得铃兰与骑士套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用，也可兑换为<Assistant_Red>2</>张神眷牌。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容</>获得，或在<Assistant_System>美神馈赠商店</>中使用<Assistant_Red>2</>张神眷牌兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Lily and Knight】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description:</>God-Favored Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Use:</>After use, obtain the Lily and Knight set; you can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it, or exchange it for <Assistant_Red>2</> God-Favored Cards.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition:</>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon-Spirit World Renewal</>, or exchanged in the <Assistant_System>Gifts of the Beauty God Shop</> using <Assistant_Red>2</> God-Favored Cards",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者： </>\n    四方联赛拍卖即将开启，由于您未参与本周四方联赛，故无法获得本周拍卖分红，详细规则信息见四方联赛玩法说明。参与四方联赛可获得丰厚奖励，期待您下次与俱乐部成员一同参与。"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n The Four-Way League auction is about to begin. Since you did not participate in this week's Four-Way League, you are not eligible for this week's auction dividends. See the Four-Way League gameplay instructions for detailed rules. Participating in the Four-Way League can earn you generous rewards. We look forward to you participating with your club members next time.",
    ["<P_Heart>（叹气）</>至少，我们还有这么多来自故乡的同伴。"] = "<P_Heart> (sighing) </> At least, we still have so many companions from home.",
    ["<h>羊皮纸和羽毛笔</>"] = "<h>Parchment and fountain pen</>",
    ["Boss_西幻龙最终版"] = "Boss_Western Fantasy Dragon Final Version",
    ["……嘿嘿，现在我每天都会处理一下衣物，盖住了味道，大家就会和我说话了吧？"] = "…Hehe, now I deal with my clothes every day, covering up the smell, will everyone talk to me then?",
    ["……怎么哭得更厉害了？不是说格尔曼能止住小孩的哭嚎吗，唉，我可不擅长哄孩子啊……"] = "……Why is it crying even harder? Didn't they say Gehrman could stop a child's wailing? Sigh, I'm not good at coaxing children……",
    ["　　戈登和戴维发现了山顶一个被积雪覆盖的遗迹入口，他们回到营地，将消息报告给曼斯教授，教授当即带着一些学者和几个护卫往山上赶。\n　　而我和另外几个学员则留在了营地，准备必要的物资。边搬东西的时候我边想，不久后我也要称呼他们为\"研究员先生\"了吧。\n　　新遗迹的考古研究相当累人，研究员们还在遗迹入口考察建筑风格，而我们这些不受重视的学员就只能干剩下的粗重杂活……\n　　傍晚回到营地后，曼斯教授很兴奋，有几个研究员提议在营地开个庆功宴，曼斯教授也同意了，大家终于能放松一下了。"] = "　　Gordon and David discovered a ruins entrance covered by snow at the summit. They returned to the camp and reported the news to Professor Mans. The professor immediately took some scholars and a few guards and rushed up the mountain.\n　　As for me and a few other students, we stayed at the camp to prepare the necessary supplies. While moving things, I thought to myself that before long, I would also be calling them \"Mr. Researcher.\"\n　　The archaeological research of the new ruins is quite exhausting. The researchers are still examining the architectural style at the ruins entrance, while we, the undervalued students, can only do the remaining heavy, menial work...\n　　After returning to the camp in the evening, Professor Mans was very excited. Several researchers proposed holding a celebration party at the camp, and Professor Mans agreed. Everyone could finally relax a bit.",
